This agreement covers Nexa: the Nexa Dashboard (@kufayeka/node-red-nexa-dashboard) and the plugins that come with it
(@kufayeka/nexa-component-ui-library, @kufayeka/nexa-component-svg, @kufayeka/nexa-component-basic-shapes), in the
compiled form in which they are distributed (the "Software"). By installing or using the Software you accept these terms.
If you do not accept them, do not install or use it.

1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   The Software is free of charge. The licensor grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to:

   a. install the Software on computers you control, and run it inside Node-RED, for any purpose, including commercial
      use: you may build, run and sell applications, dashboards and screens made WITH the Software;
   b. make the copies of the installer that you need to install it on your own computers (a backup, a second machine of yours);
   c. write your own plugins for it (components, Logic nodes) with the plugin interface (sdk/nexa-component-sdk.js, "the
      SDK facade"), and use, license and distribute those plugins as you wish (see 3).

2. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

   You may not, and may not let anybody else:

   a. copy, publish, sell, rent, lease, lend, sub-license or otherwise distribute the Software, or any part of it, to anyone
      who is not you (this includes putting it on a public or shared repository, a file-sharing site or a package registry);
   b. modify the Software, fork it, or make works derived from it, except plugins as described in 3;
   c. reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, de-obfuscate or otherwise try to recover the source code of the Software, or
      remove or work around the obfuscation, any license check or any other protection in it, except where the law of your
      country gives you that right and does not allow the agreement to take it away;
   d. remove or change any copyright, license or proprietary notice in the Software;
   e. use the Software, or what you learn from taking it apart, to make or help make a product that competes with it;
   f. use the Software in a way that breaks the law, or in a way that harms others.

3. YOUR PLUGINS

